			description: [
				"One &bIron Froglight&r, one furnace. Smelt it and it runs down into a bar of plain &firon&r."
				""
				"There it is - your first iron ingot, grown on an island that had none, and not one swing of a pickaxe to show for it."
				""
				"Now scale it. The frogs don't tire."
			]
			tasks: [{ id: "6C1F0A2B3D4E5F74", item: { count: 1, id: "minecraft:iron_ingot" }, type: "item" }]
			rewards: [{ id: "6C1F0A2B3D4E5F75", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
		}
	]
